# The build context for every image in this repository is the repository root,
# because both the relay and the daemon depend on workspace siblings. Without
# this file that context is the whole tree — including `node_modules/`, which
# the Dockerfiles reinstall from the lockfile anyway, and `.git/`.
#
# `apps/relay/.dockerignore` is not consulted for those builds: Docker reads the
# `.dockerignore` beside the context root, and the context root is here.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
plugin/build
